OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny spots of
OL,6,Frain will clear away this evening. The
OL,7,Frest of the night will then be dry
OL,8,Fwith some clear intervals, these
OL,9,Fmainly across Orkney. Quite breezy.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FIt will be a mainly cloudy
OL,12,Fday with just a few bright intervals
OL,13,Fbreaking through. A few showers are
OL,14,Fpossible. Feeling warmer.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,17,Fmixed period with variable amounts of
OL,18,Fcloud and sunny spells. Some showery
OL,19,Fbursts of rain at times too, briefly
OL,20,Fheavy. A warm start then turning
OL,21,Fcooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
